Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 15:41:26 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 7/8] mu: host-supplied images for BitmapData.loadBitmap (GFx
 game images)

GFx lets the game provide the bitmaps of a movie's external images (the
client renders its item icons into base.swf's image0 and the bar draws
them with loadBitmap).  Player::set_gfx_image registers or updates an
image by export name; BitmapData.loadBitmap returns it, sharing the
pixels, before looking at the movie's library.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 core/src/avm1/globals/bitmap_data.rs | 11 +++++++++
 core/src/avm1/runtime.rs             | 17 ++++++++++++++
 core/src/player.rs                   | 35 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 63 insertions(+)

